  "rules": [
    "Scan only files present in the exact TARGET competition Hash Lineage runtime closure.",
    "Recall every TARGET runtime consumer of the registered execution identity, business reference, Agent1 business-output, and writeback fields with exact path and SHA-256.",
    "itemExecutionId+inputContentHash is the only Agent1 output binding authority after the hash gate.",
    "storeId/productId/signalId remain business references projected from the exact input Artifact; they cannot re-own execution matching.",
    "Legacy V22.5.8 may canonicalize decision aliases and V22.5.5 may shape executionLock, but neither may delete an exact-hash-matched judgment by business rematching or an old action-family whitelist.",
    "Unknown/new action-family intent may remain in Agent1 output; current downstream Action Matrix/capability boundaries decide whether it is executable.",
    "Canonical V23 Registry roots remain sealed; this hotfix uses a hash-anchored semantic overlay."
